00:40.880">blue</span><span begin="00:40.880" end="00:41.360">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.360" end="00:44.660"><span begin="00:41.360" end="00:41.660">We </span><span begin="00:41.660" end="00:42.200">come </span><span begin="00:42.200" end="00:42.770">around </span><span begin="00:42.770" end="00:43.070">here </span><span begin="00:43.070" end="00:43.430">all </span><span begin="00:43.430" end="00:43.610">the </span><span begin="00:43.610" end="00:44.660">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.290" end="00:50.930"><span begin="00:45.290" end="00:45.620">Got </span><span begin="00:45.620" end="00:45.650">a </span><span begin="00:45.650" end="00:45.980">lot </span><span begin="00:45.980" end="00:46.190">to </span><span begin="00:46.190" end="00:46.970">not </span><span begin="00:46.970" end="00:47.870">do</span><span begin="00:47.870" end="00:47.900">, </span><span begin="00:47.900" end="00:48.170">let </span><span begin="00:48.170" end="00:48.290">me </span><span begin="00:48.290" end="00:48.680">kill </span><span begin="00:48.680" end="00:48.920">it </span><span begin="00:48.920" end="00:49.940">with </span><span begin="00:49.940" end="00:50.930">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.170" end="00:54.740"><span begin="00:51.170" end="00:51.500">You </span><span begin="00:51.500" end="00:51.890">pick </span><span begin="00:51.890" end="00:52.280">me </span><span begin="00:52.280" end="00:52.610">up </span><span begin="00:52.610" end="00:52.820">and </span><span begin="00:52.820" end="00:53.180">take </span><span begin="00:53.180" end="00:53.420">me </span><span begin="00:53.420" end="00:53.870">home </span><span begin="00:53.870" end="00:54.740">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.890" end="00:57.080"><span begin="00:54.890" end="00:55.580">Head </span><span begin="00:55.580" end="00:55.730">out </span><span begin="00:55.730" end="00:55.850">the </span><span begin="00:55.850" end="00:56.480">window </span><span begin="00:56.480" end="00:57.080">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.080" end="01:01.160"><span begin="00:57.080" end="00:57.380">We're </span><span begin="00:57.380" end="00:58.040">hollow </span><span begin="00:58.040" end="00:58.400">like </span><span begin="00:58.400" end="00:58.670">the </span><span begin="00:58.670" end="00:59.420">bottles </span><span begin="00:59.420" end="00:59.720">that </span><span begin="00:59.720" end="00:59.960">we </span><span begin="00:59.960" end="01:01.160">drain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.640" end="01:05.270"><span begin="01:01.640" end="01:01.940">You </span><span begin="01:01.940" end="01:02.360">drape </span><span begin="01:02.360" end="01:02.600">your </span><span begin="01:02.600" end="01:03.080">wrists </span><span begin="01:03.080" end="01:03.620">over </span><span begin="01:03.620" end="01:03.770">the </span><span begin="01:03.770" end="01:04.490">steering </span><span begin="01:04.490" end="01:05.270">wheel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.300" end="01:07.910"><span begin="01:05.300" end="01:06.200">Pulses </span><span begin="01:06.200" end="01:06.500">can </span><span begin="01:06.500" end="01:06.860">drive </span><span begin="01:06.860" end="01:07.070">from </span><span begin="01:07.070" end="01:07.910">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.120" end="01:11.240"><span begin="01:08.120" end="01:08.450">We </span><span begin="01:08.450" end="01:08.840">might </span><span begin="01:08.840" end="01:09.080">be </span><span begin="01:09.080" end="01:09.800">hollow </span><span begin="01:09.800" end="01:10.130">but </span><span begin="01:10.130" end="01:10.400">we're </span><span begin="01:10.400" end="01:11.240">brave</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.240" end="01:13.400"><span begin="01:11.240" end="01:12.050">（</span><span begin="01:12.050" end="01:12.530">And </span><span begin="01:12.530" end="01:12.710">I </span><span begin="01:12.710" end="01:13.100">like </span><span begin="01:13.100" en