gin="01:24.500" end="01:24.770">that </span><span begin="01:24.770" end="01:25.190">we </span><span begin="01:25.190" end="01:26.030">stopped </span><span begin="01:26.030" end="01:27.080">kissing </span><span begin="01:27.080" end="01:27.230">the </span><span begin="01:27.230" end="01:27.800">tar </span><span begin="01:27.800" end="01:28.160">on </span><span begin="01:28.160" end="01:28.310">the </span><span begin="01:28.310" end="01:29.330">highway</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.330" end="01:29.750"><span begin="01:29.330" end="01:29.400">（</span><span begin="01:29.400" end="01:29.470">And </span><span begin="01:29.470" end="01:29.540">I </span><span begin="01:29.540" end="01:29.610">like </span><span begin="01:29.610" end="01:29.680">you</span><span begin="01:29.680" end="01:29.750">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.750" end="01:32.120"><span begin="01:29.750" end="01:29.960">We </span><span begin="01:29.960" end="01:30.440">move </span><span begin="01:30.440" end="01:30.740">in </span><span begin="01:30.740" end="01:30.830">the </span><span begin="01:30.830" end="01:31.220">tree </span><span begin="01:31.220" end="01:32.120">streets</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.300" end="01:34.940"><span begin="01:32.300" end="01:32.600">I'd </span><span begin="01:32.600" end="01:33.080">like </span><span begin="01:33.080" end="01:33.350">it </span><span begin="01:33.350" end="01:33.650">if </span><span begin="01:33.650" end="01:33.800">you </span><span begin="01:33.800" end="01:34.940">stayed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.450" end="01:37.610"><span begin="01:35.450" end="01:35.750">Now </span><span begin="01:35.750" end="01:35.930">we're </span><span begin="01:35.930" end="01:36.200">wearing </span><span begin="01:36.200" end="01:36.440">long </span><span begin="01:36.440" end="01:37.610">sleeves</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.120" end="01:39.530"><span begin="01:38.120" end="01:38.330">And </span><span begin="01:38.330" end="